The generated game database (gameinfodb.ugd)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Every gameinfodb.ugd this program writes is generated from the ACE world
database published by the ACEmulator project:

  ACE-World-16PY-Patches  https://github.com/ACEmulator/ACE-World-16PY-Patches
  ACE-World-16PY          https://github.com/ACEmulator/ACE-World-16PY

both licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0. The generated
file is a work derived from that data and is distributed under the same
license, AGPL-3.0. The exact release it was built from is named in
ace-world.json (repository, release, asset and SHA-256).

Credit and thanks to the ACEmulator team and the many people who collected
and curated the ACE world data.

The rankings in the file (the ammunition Quality column, the order of each
damage list, the rule for when a monster gets its own list, the Special
groups) are this project's own rules, described in README.md.

